      "id": "greet",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "The taproom of the Drop, and a man with sand in every crease of him drinking something he has clearly earned."
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dry,” he says, meaning the hole and possibly the drink. “Nine holes this season and all of them dry.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "glass_ferruh_size",
          "text": "That cistern is enormous for a village this size.",
